   $q$What is the author's main purpose in the first four paragraphs?$q$, $q$[{"text":"to persuade readers to buy a new watch","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"invents-persuasion"},{"text":"to describe a trip on the town train","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-detail"},{"text":"to tell how and why the town clock was built","is_correct":true},{"text":"to teach readers how to fix an old clock","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$to tell how and why the town clock was built$q$, $q$These paragraphs tell the history of the clock, from people missing the train to the clock being finished in 1892. They do not teach how to fix a clock.$q$, 'draft', 'a713643f-eef3-5c0a-b28b-094c20190968')
