   $q$Which list shows how one event led to the next in the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A flood came, the farmers moved away, and then the town became smaller.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"The town grew, a flood stopped the boat, and then the town built a bridge.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-order"},{"text":"The town built a school, a flood came, and then farmers lost their money.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-order"},{"text":"A flood stopped the boat, the town built a bridge, and then the town grew.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$A flood stopped the boat, the town built a bridge, and then the town grew.$q$, $q$The flood kept farmers from the market, which led to the bridge, and the bridge made the town grow. The choice saying the town became smaller goes against the text, which says new families moved in.$q$, 'draft', '33cfed1a-afcb-5891-8b12-791fe3865987')
